&_nc_oc=Adlqs2TPzR5ZhJE991szjc00NXCPJ66jJpVs9qIghx31LPJF7jHBMWxiPC6g4bMwYqw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzRN2RoIMcw2GTkP5AYWQCmmOebpGVF6noK0XG2m075CQ&oe=69B6B81E"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "975198817093493", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566693_975198820426826_7097624739394196541_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QiFa0cxABrEQ7kNvwFG5-WL&_nc_oc=AdnrBBJluqahmbJ8WWtSvMbF5FnAUYcukQIK_uGhnYTtwcqxNSz8TrJRt3BoZ1IFTFw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwTdsQzAkOolG-9kBaEi2JIIEGJuWA235UJMb40YK5SBw&oe=69B6B9CC"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "415893571368646", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001715_415893574701979_3461447245540982035_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ot7b25U9qdwQ7kNvwGrQIua&_nc_oc=Adk2MoyrtwVS7V5H96_UVmJpOYWVX-C-kgt7FpfsR6SoUciU0g9hkrddEHIFTiiOsCQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwoWLIsbKFQ6Hpaz2WYc-hFqjEPYr5U4K_KJHX8r6KEAQ&oe=69B69CD6"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "662596896051796", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974523_662596899385129_8527079563659693432_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7nqK_5izXoEQ7kNvwGCIlJY&_nc_oc=AdmzDESRuhOs7eedlhFEiAtiFQOgEeEXlXZYXm_ZC68BxYMwSNzZox2ztW6jbhBbAPQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxeYTr-SgiEnbz81TULbPM6SZTEoaqKyvoP7fb2i7VuuQ&oe=69B69B54"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "gameplayVR3.png", "id": "492345567046352", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974804_492345570379685_6511341930176300148_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GRmxqYQC4XkQ7kNvwFBTVLJ&_nc_oc=Adkb-uixpxYuhS3qu95EX-NFiXs6XffevbM40h7iPY82m5jkTN8-L2apCiSdKcymCG4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyd-HXN9PNjt4AzXf4jMGZJ2Y8iF_iI1Dp1-8WaUg4TSA&oe=69B6A6AD"}, "display_name": "Escape Simulator", "keywords": ["escape", "room", "coop", "multiplayer", "simulator"], "long_description": "Escape Simulator is a first-person puzzler you can **play solo or in an online co-op** (best with 2-3 players, but playable with up to 8!). Explore a growing set of **highly interactive escape rooms**. Pick up and examine everything, break objects, solve locks, and decipher puzzles to escape! After finishing the main game, watch for free content updates and explore rooms **built by our awesome community**.\n\n# \u2b50**REVIEWS** \n\"What I've seen has left me considerably impressed.\" - UploadVR\n\n# \u2692\ufe0f**COMMUNITY-MADE ROOMS**\nAfter finishing the main game **explore numerous rooms** built by our amazing community.\n\n# \ud83e\udd1d**ONLINE CO-OP**\nAll rooms are playable in an online co-op. Play with up to 8 players (best played with 2-3). Customize your character and join friends to solve puzzles together. More heads are better than one!\n\n# \ud83e\udde9**INTERACTIVE PUZZLES**\nExplore 28+ official rooms filled with puzzles designed by real-life escape room operators. If it\u2019s not nailed down, you can pick it up.\n\n# \ud83d\udd0d**EXEMINE EVERYTHING**\nRead books, examine ancient artifacts, and find clues to riddles. Need to cross-reference a clue? No problem - just pin it!\n\n# \ud83c\udfc6**WANT MORE?**\nThe game features additional content in the form of Addons with 4 large rooms each: \n- **Steampunk**: Solve four new rooms on the beautiful steampunk airship \"Valor.\"\n- **Wild West**: Become an outlaw in the Wild West.\n- **Magic**: Embrace your magic potential, and follow in the footsteps of great witches and wizards. \n\n", "short_description": "First-person puzzler you can play solo or in an online co-op. Explore a set of highly interactive escape rooms. Move furniture, pick up and examine everything, smash pots and break locks! Supports community rooms through the level editor."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pinestudio.c